            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a single tree using the SHA1 value or ref name for that tree.\n\nIf `truncated` is `true` in the response then the number of items in the `tree` array exceeded our maximum limit. If you need to fetch more items, use the non-recursive method of fetching trees, and fetch one sub-tree at a time.\n\n\n**Note**: The limit for the `tree` array is 100,000 entries with a maximum size of 7 MB when using the `recursive` parameter.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
